{"id":"452393","name":"春笋排骨汤","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/452393/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"春笋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨冷水入锅焯水。","img":"images/452393/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"水开煮一会儿，过凉水，洗干净。","img":"images/452393/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"春笋尖切块。","img":"images/452393/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"春笋加一点盐焯水。","img":"images/452393/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"春笋焯完水过凉水洗一下，可以去除草酸，和排骨一起放入电高压锅。","img":"images/452393/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"高压锅压30分钟就可以了。","img":"images/452393/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"起锅，加盐、鸡精、胡椒粉调味，加枸杞和香菜就可以上桌了。","img":"images/452393/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"开吃了。","img":"images/452393/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"来一块大排骨😃。","img":"images/452393/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}